              cially when performing cross‐domain mounting.  For this function
              to work, the _A_m_d variable ${hostd} is used, requiring that ${do‐
              main} not be null.


       hheessiioodd__bbaassee (string, default=automount)
              Specify the base name for hesiod maps.


       kkaarrcchh (string, default to karch of the system)
              Same  as  the --kk option to Amd.  Allows you to override the ker‐
